        {
          "id": 517873537,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I thought (but haven't checked) that it was 50 for the first line, then 80 for the rest? I find myself watching the column number in the corner of vi while (re)writing the lines to make them fit.  It also changes colour if I go too far.\n\nIt is nice to see a short/concise first line, but I do sometimes struggle to work it into something meaningful within the budget.\n\nOn balance, I'd rather retain this check, but it would make sense to try to catch this in git commithook rather than have the pipeline fail.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6810036,
            "username": "martin.r.mathieson",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Martin Mathieson",
            "state": "active",
