        {
          "id": 518169118,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "50 for the subject isn't a hard limit, I think.\n\nLike @martin.r.mathieson said, this should be caught in a git commit hook. I agree it is annoying to have a pipeline fail over this but good, consistent, easy to read commit messages are important and worthwhile.",
