      "title": "RFC: Do not enforce a 80 character commit message length on gitlab testing",
      "message": "RFC: Do not enforce a 80 character commit message length on gitlab testing\n\n    Our developers are not particpants in a comedy sketch.\n\n    In way too many places (1) in our CI code we wait for the developer to do\n    something wrong, leap out from behind the bushes, yell \"AHA!\", and hit\n    them in the face with a herring^W error dialog.\n\n    We really need to not do that.\n\n    If the developer managed to locally commit without a problem, this test\n    *must not* be allowed to break the commit process on gitlab.\n\n    (Paraphrased from f229aeddd2f36e8b136f344b68ac43bdde7506d2)\n",
      "author_name": "Joerg Mayer",
